{"id":"wb-6-1017","name":"丘逢甲故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"丘逢甲故居","text":"丘逢甲故居，又称培远堂，位于中国广东省梅州市蕉岭县文福镇逢甲村（原村名淡定村），是丘逢甲离开台湾后在祖籍地建造的住宅。建筑采用两堂四横一围龙布局，共有房屋55间。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%98%E9%80%A2%E7%94%B2%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":95385072,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95385072","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0193f9ca97ec30f6ba7ceb3b.jpg","title":"邱逢甲故居-01_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%82%B1%E9%80%A2%E7%94%B2%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85-01_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/%E9%82%B1%E9%80%A2%E7%94%B2%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85-01_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"BV3CM","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"邱逢甲故居-01","width":320,"height":240}}